

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Program manajemén-mémori: 0.

>> txt := ['Word Salad'].
Kaluaran tulis: ['Text Length: '] + txt panjang, baris-anyar.
Kaluaran tulis: ['Character at 2:'] + ( txt karakter: 2 ), baris-anyar.
Kaluaran tulis: (( txt téangan: ['S'] ) - 0), baris-anyar.

Program beresihan.

usedMemory1 := (Program mémori ? 0).


